---
globs: *.puml
alwaysApply: false
---
When creating PlantUML diagrams, always follow the APIs on https://plantuml.com/.

Only create one diagram style per file as the PlantUML API does not support multiple different diagrams in one file.

When asked to create UML diagrams without specifying the exact type, create

1. Component diagram (https://plantuml.com/component-diagram)
2. Sequence diagram (https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram)
3. Activity diagram (https://plantuml.com/activity-diagram-beta)
